ted the mission to produce a  definitive answer about the origin of  covid-19 and a second phase of research  is required but as International  criticism builds over China's role in  the study they may find that Wuhan  becomes increasingly like this former  seafood market blocked off and  impossible to access Katrina you Al  Jazeera Wuhan
 

